T*
(during which the Lessee may not terminate the Lease.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. ESCALATION. The rent shall escalate by ten percent \(10%\) at the end of) Tj
T*
(every twelve \(12\) month period.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. MAINTENANCE. The Lessee shall bear all charges for routine maintenance,) Tj
T*
(minor repairs, water and electricity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. TERMINATION. After the lock-in period, either party may terminate this) Tj
T*
(Lease by giving three \(3\) months' written notice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
